    N1 -->|privileged read/write/ioctl| U
    U --> S[init + SELinux AEE domain on MTK branches]
    X[Exact Fire PS7330 shell UID 2000] -.->|read=0, write=0| N0
    X -.->|read=0, write=0| N1
    X -.->|read=0, write=0| T[/dev/atf_log]
    Q[GhostLock native/Bionic futex PI] --> F[Linux futex / rtmutex kernel path]
    F -. separate from AEE .-> K

